# `pipelines.watch`

Live typed run/step updates for a pipeline run (or all runs).

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.pipelines.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `all` | `map` |
| `pipeline_run_id` | `string` |

## Returns

`WatchEvent` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `patches` | `map` |
| `err` | `map` |
| `hb` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call pipelines.watch --json '{ "all": {}, "pipeline_run_id": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

